# GrowthOS - AI-Powered Knowledge Management System

## Project Overview
GrowthOS is a sophisticated knowledge management and learning platform that combines AI-powered content curation, self-testing capabilities, and goal-oriented learning. The application features a modern, production-ready interface with comprehensive user onboarding, profile management, and intelligent knowledge organization.

## Technology Stack & Dependencies

### Core Framework
- **Next.js 15.3.3** - React framework with App Router
- **React 18.3.1** - UI library with hooks and modern patterns
- **React DOM 18.3.1** - DOM rendering

### UI & Styling
- **Tailwind CSS 3.1.10** - Utility-first CSS framework
- **tailwindcss-animate 1.0.7** - Animation utilities
- **Radix UI Components**:
  - `@radix-ui/react-avatar` - Avatar component primitives
  - `@radix-ui/react-slot` - Slot component for composition
- **Lucide React 0.515.0** - Icon library (primary icon source)
- **class-variance-authority 0.7.1** - CVA for component variants
- **clsx 2.1.1** - Conditional className utility
- **tailwind-merge 3.3.1** - Tailwind class merging

### Data & Backend Integration
- **Supabase 2.50.0** - Database, authentication, and real-time features
- **OpenAI 4.104.0** - AI/LLM integration for embeddings and text processing

### Content Processing & Visualization
- **react-markdown 8.0.7** - Markdown rendering
- **recharts 3.0.2** - Data visualization and charts
- **formidable 2.1.1** - File upload handling
- **mammoth 1.7.0** - DOCX file processing
- **pdf-parse 1.1.1** - PDF file processing

### Development & Quality
- **ESLint 9** with Next.js config - Code linting
- **Autoprefixer 10.4.21** - CSS vendor prefixing
- **PostCSS 8.5.5** - CSS processing

## Architecture Patterns

### File Organization
- **App Router Structure** - Next.js 13+ app directory pattern
- **Component-Based Architecture** - Reusable UI components
- **API Routes** - Serverless functions in `/app/api/`
- **Modular Libraries** - Organized in `/lib/` directory
- **Utility Functions** - Helper functions in `/utils/`

### Key Components & Features
- **SidebarNavigation** - Responsive navigation with mobile support
- **BoltBadge** - Certification badge with multiple variants
- **Dashboard Analytics** - Charts and data visualization
- **Knowledge Management** - CRUD operations with AI processing
- **Self-Testing System** - Multiple choice and free-text questions
- **User Profiles** - Complete onboarding and profile management
- **File Upload** - Support for .txt, .md, PDF, and DOCX files

### State Management
- **React Hooks** - useState, useEffect, custom hooks
- **Local Storage** - Client-side data persistence
- **Supabase Real-time** - Live data synchronization

### Styling Approach
- **Gradient Backgrounds** - `bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-lime-50 to-green-100`
- **Glass Morphism** - `bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm`
- **Lime Color Scheme** - Primary brand colors using lime variants
- **Responsive Design** - Mobile-first approach with breakpoints
- **Animation & Transitions** - Smooth hover effects and micro-interactions

### API Integration
- **RESTful APIs** - Standard HTTP methods
- **Serverless Functions** - Next.js API routes
- **External AI Services** - Azure OpenAI integration
- **Database Operations** - Supabase client-side SDK

## Design System

### Color Palette
- **Primary**: Lime variants (lime-50 to lime-900)
- **Secondary**: Gray variants for text and borders
- **Accent**: Green variants for success states
- **Error**: Red variants for error states

### Typography
- **Headings**: Montserrat font family
- **Body Text**: Inter font family
- **Font Weights**: 400 (normal), 600 (semibold), 700 (bold)

### Component Patterns
- **Cards**: Rounded corners with subtle shadows
- **Buttons**: Multiple variants (default, ghost, outline)
- **Forms**: Consistent input styling with focus states
- **Navigation**: Collapsible sidebar with responsive behavior

## Development Guidelines

### Code Style
- **JSX Syntax** - React components with modern patterns
- **ES6+ Features** - Arrow functions, destructuring, async/await
- **Modular Imports** - Organized import statements
- **Error Handling** - Comprehensive try-catch blocks

### Performance Considerations
- **Image Optimization** - Next.js Image component
- **Code Splitting** - Dynamic imports where appropriate
- **Caching Strategies** - API response caching
- **Bundle Optimization** - Tree shaking and minification

### Accessibility
- **ARIA Labels** - Proper accessibility attributes
- **Keyboard Navigation** - Tab order and focus management
- **Color Contrast** - WCAG compliant color combinations
- **Screen Reader Support** - Semantic HTML structure

## Environment Configuration
- **Environment Variables** - `.env` file for sensitive data
- **Supabase Configuration** - Database and API keys
- **OpenAI Integration** - AI service credentials
- **Development/Production** - Environment-specific settings

## Build & Deployment
- **Next.js Build** - Optimized production builds
- **Static Assets** - Public directory for images and files
- **Serverless Deployment** - Compatible with Vercel, Netlify
- **Database Migrations** - Supabase schema management

This project represents a production-ready, full-stack application with modern development practices, comprehensive error handling, and a polished user experience suitable for enterprise use.